# Raw Data

---

Protein Name/Decription: Crystal Structure of Vascular Endothelial Growth Factor D
PDB ID: 2XV7
Organism: Homo sapiens
Resolution: 2.90 Å

The following files are contained in this folder:

| File              | Format          | Use                                       |
| ----------------- | --------------- | ----------------------------------------- |
| Coordinates       | Legacy.pdb      | Input for refinement/validation tools     |
| Sequence          | .fasta          | Confirm chain identity                    |
| Validation report | .pdf            | Baseline quality metrics (pre-refinement) |
| Protein Structure | .jpeg           | Biological Assembly 1                     |
